1
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,320
While I was away,

2
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:37,340
Ningcheng has been quite lively.

3
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:42,160
Back then, you dislike that Shisha Gang
was subordinate to Qingtian Gang,

4
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:44,730
and wanted to get rid of Lu Wenbiao.

5
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:47,720
I was the one supporting you
behind the scenes.

6
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:49,760
I never thought you’d be so useless

7
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:52,980
and can't even deal with Lu Ye
right under your nose.

8
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:54,760
Chief Xu,

9
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:56,480
is this how you do things?

10
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:59,000
You must be joking.

11
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:01,600
Lu Ye is just a brat.

12
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:02,970
He won't amount to much.

13
00:01:03,720 --> 00:01:06,280
He's just playing house.

14
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:07,080
Is that so?

15
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:11,680
I heard he took back quite a few
of the Qingtian Gang's territories.

16
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:14,080
They are all poor places.

17
00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:15,340
They don't worth much.

18
00:01:16,160 --> 00:01:17,000
True.

19
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:19,720
With the Shisha Gang's current status,

20
00:01:19,960 --> 00:01:22,160
it's normal not to take others seriously.

21
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:23,440
But don't forget

22
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:26,640
who you relied on
to get where you are today.

23
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:27,360
Yes.

24
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:33,240
Take care.

25
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:48,000
It was clear that you killed Lu Wenbiao,

26
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:50,330
because you couldn't control him.

27
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:54,680
Do you think I'll be your obedient dog
too?

28
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:58,220
I'll break free from you sooner or later.

29
00:01:59,320 --> 00:02:01,830
[Eclipse in the Lost City] [Episode 14]

30
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,640
Do you realize your mistake?

31
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:06,480
Chief, I know it now.

32
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:09,000
I shouldn't have stabbed Lu Ye
in the street

33
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,729
and caused such a big scene.

34
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:11,800
Idiot.

35
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:13,640
Chief, I was wrong.

36
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:14,800
I know I was wrong.

37
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:16,920
Your mistake is

38
00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:19,280
that you stabbed him but didn't kill him.

39
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,140
Embarrassing.

40
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,200
He...

41
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:22,600
He was clearly infected.

42
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:25,160
Who knows where he got the cure from.

43
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:26,800
Never mind.

44
00:02:27,340 --> 00:02:29,400
There are more important things now.

45
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:36,640
The vice president position
of the business association is vacant.

46
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:38,160
I've sacrificed a lot

47
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:40,760
to keep this position available.

48
00:02:40,760 --> 00:02:42,360
This is a good thing, Chief.

49
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:43,240
From now on,

50
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:46,400
all our businesses can be laundered
through the chamber of commerce.

51
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:48,400
We are still one step away.

52
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:53,400
The president specifically asked
for an ancient jade

53
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:54,800
named Jiangyun Pendant.

54
00:02:54,890 --> 00:02:55,840
That's easy.

55
00:02:55,930 --> 00:02:57,260
We have plenty of money.

56
00:02:58,490 --> 00:02:59,530
I'm afraid

57
00:03:00,850 --> 00:03:02,380
it's not as simple as money.

58
00:03:02,410 --> 00:03:07,090
The owner of this Jiangyun Pendant
was a professor

59
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:08,600
who passed away a few years ago.

60
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:11,400
The pendant is in the hands of his wife,
Lin Mei.

61
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,400
She is not short of money.

62
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:15,200
And her family has connections.

63
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:16,660
I can't put my hands on her.

64
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,220
What should we do then?

65
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:24,040
Whoever can get their hands on it

66
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:25,920
will get the East Street.

67
00:03:28,700 --> 00:03:29,570
Yes.

68
00:03:29,780 --> 00:03:30,290
Yes.

69
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:31,640
What are you waiting for?

70
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:32,480
I'm leaving.

71
00:03:33,880 --> 00:03:35,040
Idiots.

72
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:48,079
We agreed on ten o'clock.

73
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:49,079
You're late.

74
00:03:58,480 --> 00:04:00,160
I even gave you the key.

75
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:02,340
Why didn't you use the front door?

76
00:04:03,440 --> 00:04:04,440
It's convenient.

77
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:08,320
What about the thing I asked you to do
a few days ago?

78
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:11,200
You boss me around so naturally.

79
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:12,880
You don't even bother to be polite.

80
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:14,400
Since we are already working together,

81
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:16,660
I believe in your sincerity and ability.

82
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:21,399
Don't mention it.

83
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:24,400
I've asked a friend
to take me \to meet Lin Mei,

84
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:25,730
but she wouldn't budge.

85
00:04:29,760 --> 00:04:30,560
It's okay.

86
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:32,760
If it were that easy to get,

87
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:35,100
Xu Qingdao would have gotten it long ago.

88
00:04:49,610 --> 00:04:51,520
Didn't you say you couldn't find it?

89
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:52,320
I lied.

90
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:54,020
You believed me just like that?

91
00:04:54,020 --> 00:04:55,280
As long as I make a move,

92
00:04:55,320 --> 00:04:56,920
there's nothing I can't get.

93
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:03,650
How did you get hurt?

94
00:05:05,780 --> 00:05:06,560
It's nothing.

95
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:09,690
I accidentally got hurt
while getting the jade pendant.

96
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:17,760
This minor scratch doesn't need medicine.

97
00:05:21,540 --> 00:05:23,360
For such dangerous things in the future,

98
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,080
don't go.

99
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,400
I'll go.

100
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,170
What do you mean?

101
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:31,000
Are you saying my skills are worse
'than yours?

102
00:05:32,920 --> 00:05:35,240
You wouldn't be wrong to think that.

103
00:05:37,159 --> 00:05:38,620
I knew you were mocking me.

104
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:44,730
Why are you still wearing my broken watch?

105
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:47,480
It seems the Shisha Gang
doesn't treat you well.

106
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:50,480
Ow, ow, ow.

107
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:52,360
It's just a watch.

108
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:54,159
I'll give you a new one later.

109
00:05:55,880 --> 00:05:56,680
No need.

110
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:09,320
Do you think Xu Qingdao
wants to be the vice president so badly

111
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:11,680
because he wants to find a way out
for himself

112
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:14,080
and get rid of the person
behind the scenes?

113
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,100
It's possible.

114
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,860
He can then legitimately
launder his business too.

115
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:21,120
But he has no bottom line.

116
00:06:21,370 --> 00:06:23,040
He will definitely exploit the people

117
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,760
and yield profits to foreigners.

118
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:26,520
So we can't let him be elected.

119
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:30,860
Then let's give him hope first

120
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:32,480
so you can gain his trust,

121
00:06:33,400 --> 00:06:35,920
and then let him fall.

122
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:47,360
I didn't expect you to be
much more reliable than Hui.

123
00:06:47,840 --> 00:06:49,320
You got it so quickly.

124
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:52,040
I'll leave East Street to you.

125
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:53,580
Yes.

126
00:06:53,840 --> 00:06:54,840
Thank you, Chief.

127
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:04,460
[Dashijie]

128
00:07:03,290 --> 00:07:04,420
Have you heard of it?

129
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:06,820
Xu Qingdao was elected vice president
of the Chamber of Commerce.

130
00:07:06,820 --> 00:07:08,440
His official appointment is tomorrow.

131
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:10,200
It's just because I didn't get
the jade pendant.

132
00:07:10,200 --> 00:07:13,660
The Chief won't even let me attend
the inauguration ceremony.

133
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:16,000
Isn't this Hui?

134
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:19,240
I heard Chief Xu is about to be promoted
to Vice President.

135
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:21,040
You are his favorite.

136
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:23,600
In the future, small business owners
like us

137
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:25,800
will have to rely on your support.

138
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,440
You've got the wrong person.

139
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:28,840
I'm just a gatekeeper.

140
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:30,440
Hui,

141
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:32,040
you can't say that.

142
00:07:32,159 --> 00:07:33,000
In my opinion,

143
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:35,480
Chief Xu values you more than anyone else.

144
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,280
Think about it.

145
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:40,320
With such a big event tomorrow

146
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:41,960
and so many distinguished guests coming,

147
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:43,360
if you guard the outside,

148
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:46,659
isn't it equivalent to
protecting Chief Xu's reputation?

149
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:49,500
I'm just afraid some blind fools

150
00:07:49,520 --> 00:07:51,980
will take this opportunity
to make trouble.

151
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:53,330
What do you mean?

152
00:07:54,440 --> 00:07:55,560
Here's the thing.

153
00:07:55,780 --> 00:07:58,080
Didn't Chief Xu raise the management fee?

154
00:07:58,080 --> 00:08:00,540
It was originally
for the good of Ningcheng.

155
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:01,680
But I heard

156
00:08:01,830 --> 00:08:03,030
some vendors

157
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:06,580
want to go to the president of
Chamber of Commerce to complain.

158
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:09,200
Okay.

159
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,300
See you later, Hui.

160
00:08:20,590 --> 00:08:22,990
Are you sure he will do as you wish
tomorrow?

161
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:26,400
He lost his territory

162
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:28,200
and the chief's trust.

163
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:30,620
Coupled with his explosive temper,

164
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:32,370
I'm confident I can lure him in.

165
00:08:32,419 --> 00:08:33,220
Don't forget,

166
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:35,080
pissing people off

167
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:36,400
is what I do best.

168
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:47,360
Fresh fruit!

169
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:49,500
-Come and have a look.
-Get lost!

170
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:50,320
Move aside!

171
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,280
What is this mess?

172
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:53,200
Clean it up!

173
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,350
Clear all this out!

174
00:08:54,350 --> 00:08:55,440
Hurry up.

175
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,300
Get out of here!

176
00:08:56,590 --> 00:08:57,100
Hurry up!

177
00:08:57,100 --> 00:08:57,900
Get lost!

178
00:08:59,320 --> 00:08:59,850
Get lost!

179
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:01,040
Get out of the way!

180
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,760
What are you doing?

181
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:03,220
This...

182
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,600
Stop getting in the way.

183
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:06,730
Do you know what day it is today?

184
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:08,880
Today is the chief's inauguration.

185
00:09:08,880 --> 00:09:10,280
Be smart and get lost.

186
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:10,800
I...

187
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:12,400
I paid the management fee.

188
00:09:12,590 --> 00:09:14,070
If I can't set up my stall,

189
00:09:14,490 --> 00:09:15,210
then you...

190
00:09:15,230 --> 00:09:17,030
you should give me my money back.

191
00:09:17,670 --> 00:09:18,490
Damn it.

192
00:09:18,860 --> 00:09:20,990
You want your money back after paying?

193
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:23,000
There's no such thing in this world.

194
00:09:25,670 --> 00:09:27,190
Your Shisha Gang can't...

195
00:09:27,210 --> 00:09:29,410
can't bully people like this.

196
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:30,080
I... I...

197
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:31,560
I am bullying you, so what?

198
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:33,360
For people like you,

199
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:35,520
no one would even know if I killed you.

200
00:09:36,170 --> 00:09:36,730
You...

201
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:37,480
We...

202
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,480
Take pictures!

203
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:40,920
Take pictures, reporters.

204
00:09:40,920 --> 00:09:41,770
Make sure they are clear.

205
00:09:41,770 --> 00:09:43,500
You are from the Qingtian Gang.

206
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:46,520
The new vice president
of the chamber of commerce

207
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:47,920
charges extra management fees,

208
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:50,680
overturns stalls, and suppresses prices
to monopolize.

209
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:51,600
With a president like this...

210
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,240
Stop filming.

211
00:09:52,240 --> 00:09:54,040
Is there any hope for Ningcheng?

212
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:56,720
This kind of person doesn't deserve
to be president at all.

213
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:57,990
He oppresses the people.

214
00:09:57,990 --> 00:09:59,190
He is pure evil.

215
00:09:59,460 --> 00:10:00,680
With a president like this,

216
00:10:00,680 --> 00:10:02,910
the people of Ningcheng
will have no way to survive.

217
00:10:02,910 --> 00:10:05,570
-He doesn’t deserve to be the president.
-Lu Ye.

218
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:11,560
You brat.

219
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:13,320
You set me up

220
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:15,040
and got reporters to film me.

221
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,640
What exactly do you want?

222
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:17,720
Hui.

223
00:10:17,940 --> 00:10:19,870
You're the one who bullied people.

224
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:21,740
I just helped expose it.

225
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:24,760
I wonder if it will affect
your chief's inauguration.

226
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:27,280
Idiot.

227
00:10:27,310 --> 00:10:30,020
Do you think we don't have people
in the press?

228
00:10:30,050 --> 00:10:31,580
By the time it's published,

229
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:34,920
our chief will have already secured
the vice president position.

230
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:35,680
Chief.

231
00:10:36,110 --> 00:10:38,100
The Shisha Gang is bullying civilians
on the streets again,

232
00:10:38,100 --> 00:10:39,100
running amok.

233
00:10:40,480 --> 00:10:41,160
Chief.

234
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:43,680
Let them be.

235
00:10:43,920 --> 00:10:45,320
It's not the first time.

236
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:50,160
But this time it's at the vice president's
appointment ceremony.

237
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:51,880
The foreigners backing them
are also there.

238
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:53,940
Are you sure we shouldn't intervene?

239
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:05,730
My legs have gone jelly.

240
00:11:08,240 --> 00:11:09,880
My heart is bothering me.

241
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:11,280
Well, Wu,

242
00:11:11,460 --> 00:11:13,780
how about you go in my place?

243
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:16,520
All right.
